WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
One classroom. Two views. A shared session, controlled by the instructor.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Choose. Commit. A student answers in their own session.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.500
See the classroom respond. The instructor sees scores and controls when the question closes.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.000
Set the pace. Close the question, then advance the shared session.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Stay in the lesson. The next question arrives in the student view. Two students participate.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.500
Keep the session in context. Teacher controls and participant scores stay together.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.500
Finish the session. The instructor ends the battle. Participant work is preserved.
